; Intent 6: "make a field safe to splice into a delimited record", in the
; author's own words. The target (record-field) is outside the provable
; fragment, so this is expected to produce refutations and a NO VERDICT rather
; than a hit — the control showing shape is not what blocks these two.
(defn wanted [] [(s Str)] Str SNil
  (prop output-carries-no-tab [(s Str)]
    (not (contains 9 (str-bytes (wanted s))))))
